	"name": "Master Creative",
	"type": "feature",
	"img": "icons/tools/instruments/lute-gold-brown.webp",
	"system": {
		"description": "<p>You are a bard’s bard, versed in a wide variety of creative disciplines and underworld skills. You gain the following benefits:</p><ul><li><p>Your Dexterity, Intelligence, or Charisma increases by 1, to a maximum of 20.</p></li><li><p>You gain proficiency with the Performance skill or an expertise die if you are already proficient. You can always use Charisma when making Performance skill checks.</p></li><li><p>You gain proficiency with a musical instrument of your choice.</p></li><li><p>You gain proficiency with either a second musical instrument of your choice or one of the following: brewer’s supplies, calligrapher’s supplies, glassblower’s tools, or painter’s supplies.</p></li><li><p>You gain proficiency with disguise kits, forgery kits, navigator’s tools, or thieves’ tools.</p></li><li><p>You learn an additional battle hymn from the 1st-4th list. It does not count against your battle hymns known. </p></li></ul>",
